      "cooked": "<p>Hi! I’ve been struggling to grasp how to name documents using a naming series. I’ve spent several hours trying to figure it out and haven’t made much progress.</p>\n<p>In this case, I am trying to use a naming series for items to generate item codes with format CP-.#####</p>\n<p>Here’s my current setup:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Document naming settings for Item<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/a/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59_2_439x374.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xocq1UhL6H6lKFltL20Awu2D9Fv\" width=\"439\" height=\"374\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59_2_439x374.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/a/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59_2_658x561.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/a/ea040e8de030a88556b3c56a05b03f566d30df59.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"202020\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">783×667 21.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the Item customize form settings</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/2/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed_2_517x142.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"u4Bblw2AdOMGkF3rQwWKgYwcUkl\" width=\"517\" height=\"142\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed_2_517x142.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/2/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed_2_775x213.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/2/d2c653c8288a324946ebbbad36f064f7eb35aaed.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"232323\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">804×222 9.39 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<ul>\n<li>naming_series field on Item form</li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/e/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/e/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394_2_690x105.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"oXPFuyxJGTOiUnBxUCmVY0o09qA\" width=\"690\" height=\"105\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/e/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394_2_690x105.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/e/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394_2_1035x157.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/e/aef7a69a825ea6f5047f4e3d9b030f2620da0394_2_1380x210.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1F1F1F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1530×235 14.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Is my understanding correct that this naming series should write on save of the form? As in, the field Item Code is empty, I hit save and then it writes in an item code? Because that isn’t happening - it just says I need to fill in Item Code to save. Is the naming for items automatically linked to the item code field? Another thing I just noticed is that if I create a new item and manually type text in for Item Code it automatically writes that to Item Name- is that normal behavior?</p>\n<p>Please help me figure out what I’m not understanding here.</p>",
